    {
      "id": "104643213",
      "name": "脆皮豆腐",
      "url": "https://www.xiachufang.com/recipe/104643213/",
      "author": "RuMei美食记",
      "score": 7.4,
      "made": 2234,
      "desc": "切记：豆腐：用嫩豆腐（普通的嫩豆腐）超市里一板一板切块的那种做；【不是老豆腐、盒装豆腐、内脂豆腐】内脂豆腐太嫩了容易烂；裹粉、鸡蛋液的时候建议用手去裹轻手拿哦！选豆腐最关键",
      "ingredients": [
        {
          "name": "豆腐：用普通嫩豆腐",
          "amount": "1块"
        },
        {
          "name": "葱花",
          "amount": "适量"
        },
        {
          "name": "玉米淀粉",
          "amount": "半碗"
        },
        {
          "name": "鸡蛋",
          "amount": "1个"
        },
        {
          "name": "生抽",
          "amount": "2勺"
        },
        {
          "name": "蚝油",
          "amount": "1勺"
        },
        {
          "name": "老抽",
          "amount": "几滴"
        },
        {
          "name": "白糖",
          "amount": "半勺"
        }
      ],
      "stepCount": 4,
      "lists": [
        "popular"
      ],
      "rank": {
        "popular": 13
      },
      "image": {
        "local": "images/2026-11-15/104643213.jpg",
        "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/e88fc12162e74eb38b1f4303d3205538_1078w_720h.jpg"
      },
      "category": "家常菜",
      "steps": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "1先来调一碗酱汁，碗中加入生抽、老抽、蚝油、白糖，加入一勺玉米淀粉和半碗清水搅拌均匀备用",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/262f960ff8614469833cb78c409a74d1_1080w_1438h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "豆腐切成厚片，裹上玉米淀粉，再裹上蛋液,放入锅里煎至两面金黄",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/114810b256d04bdcbe76b4bec67ee834_1080w_1438h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "倒入调好的酱汁小火焖煮至汤汁浓稠即可，记得轻轻翻动哦!脆皮豆腐完成",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/363e9078be6e48aa82163a11d958766e_1078w_720h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "开吃咯！",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/afa2ecfa20774db2807851cae3af09f2_795w_722h.jpg"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "107499508",
      "name": "🥜花生酥饼，拜托都给我去做，好吃绝了👍",
      "url": "https://www.xiachufang.com/recipe/107499508/",
      "author": "Dana大拿",
      "score": 8.0,
      "made": 43,
      "desc": "这款花生酥饼🥜，真的强烈建议你们去做，用料都非常朴实，但真的好吃惨了。入口的口感非常的蓬松轻盈，属于入口即化，而且做法也巨简单。甜度我做了减糖，吃起来不会太甜腻，所以不建议再减糖了。喜甜的姐妹可以在我这个基础上➕10或20克的糖。我觉得50克糖的甜度刚刚好",
      "ingredients": [
        {
          "name": "黄油",
          "amount": "100克"
        },
        {
          "name": "低筋面粉",
          "amount": "225克"
        },
        {
          "name": "糖粉",
          "amount": "50克"
        },
        {
          "name": "泡打粉",
          "amount": "5克"
        },
        {
          "name": "鸡蛋",
          "amount": "1个"
        },
        {
          "name": "熟花生碎",
          "amount": "70克"
        }
      ],
      "stepCount": 14,
      "lists": [
        "popular"
      ],
      "rank": {
        "popular": 16
      },
      "image": {
        "local": "images/2026-11-15/107499508.jpg",
        "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/f0fdcc3e62d141dd91778fad273cd517_1920w_2560h.jpg"
      },
      "category": "烘焙甜点",
      "steps": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "黄油室温软化",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/310c118d745542eb87cdea7cae3ca5e1_2560w_2560h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "加入糖粉搅拌均匀",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/fbffae2e92d444848bbbd52f0eefdfd0_2560w_2560h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "打发蓬松",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/d090c0fc15fa47a8b1304c32ed0110e8_2560w_2560h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "常温全蛋液分2次加入黄油中，打发均匀",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/c6ee1bb6030244bf8c1afc492044bc12_2560w_2560h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "筛入低筋面粉和泡打粉",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/95a4f94efc2b4818959179191232205a_2560w_2560h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "翻拌均匀成无干粉的面团",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/ab207a3b4277470190d857aceef75f8f_2560w_2560h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "分成21克/个大小的面团，搓成小球，一共可以做20块",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/987cf105051a4157bcf4529165340e92_2560w_2560h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "表面沾点蛋液（这里的蛋液是另外再打一个鸡蛋）",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/647aaf690dac432e814c2dd57af51076_2560w_2560h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 9,
          "text": "再沾上熟花生碎",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/3bb471cb519145a2a2fd618bd01cf479_2560w_2560h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 10,
          "text": "轻轻按扁，摆入烤盘中",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/4e2e13ebd9564fa6ae26f1e19fe39f1f_2560w_2560h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 11,
          "text": "送入预热好的烤箱175°烤25分钟（根据自家烤箱的脾气自行调节温差）",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/be05f240f2d34cd88318df0597eaa78a_2560w_2560h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 12,
          "text": "烤好出炉啦",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/b4702b4876934a0098730eacd4d791f5_1280w_720h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 13,
          "text": "又香又酥",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/2b576830feee4cf5a15bb871ee05499b_3414w_2560h.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "n": 14,
          "text": "超级好吃的花生酥饼，推荐你们都去做",
          "image": {
            "local": null,
            "source": "https://i2.chuimg.com/3b3c2e2036f442f19a3bbb35c4e523b3_3414w_2560h.jpg"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
